  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Resident Coordinators Office 2016-21 - UN Resident Coordinators Office 2016-21 NS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UN Resident Coordinators Office 2016-21</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Office of the UN Resident Coordinator, RCO, in Colombia. The
UN has an extensive presence in the country. Coordination and cooperation,
internally and externally, is important  but demanding  and a strong RCO is
crucial for the UN&apos;s continued role in Colombia. The contribution therefore aims
to strengthen the RCO, in line with the UN reform, and thereby to strengthen the
UNsystems&apos; role in peacebuilding in Colombia, through increased capacity for
joint analysis, planning, information management and communication.
Sida supports two strategic positions at the RCO in Colombia, of which one is
Swedish and one is local, and also contributes funding to rapid strategic and
catalytic activities of importance for the implementation of the peace agreement
between the government and the FARC, as well as the conditions for a complete
peace.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till kontoret f&#xf6;r FN-systemets gemensamma land-koordinator, UN Resident Coordinator&#x2019;s Office (RCO), i Colombia. 
FN har en omfattande n&#xe4;rvaro i landet. Samordning och samarbete, internt och externt, &#xe4;r viktigt men kr&#xe4;vande och ett starkt RCO &#xe4;r avg&#xf6;rande f&#xf6;r FN:s fortsatta roll i Colombia. Insatsen &#xe4;mnar d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r st&#xe4;rka RCO, i linje med FN-reformen, och d&#xe4;rigenom FN:s roll i fredsbyggandet i Colombia, genom &#xf6;kad kapacitet f&#xf6;r gemensam analys, planering, informationshantering och kommunikation. 
Sida st&#xf6;djer tv&#xe5; strategiska positioner vid RCO i Colombia, varav en svensk och en lokalanst&#xe4;lld, och bidrar &#xe4;ven med finansiering till snabba strategiska och katalytiska aktiviteter av vikt f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av fredsavtalet mellan regeringen och FARC, samt f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r en fullst&#xe4;ndig fred.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Office of the UN Resident Coordinator, RCO, in Colombia.
The UN has an extensive presence in the country. Coordination and cooperation, internally and externally, is important but demanding and a strong RCO is crucial for the UN&apos;s continued role in Colombia. The effort therefore aims to strengthen the RCO, in line with the UN reform, and thereby the UN&apos;s role in peacebuilding in Colombia, through increased capacity for joint analysis, planning, information management and communication.
Sida supports two strategic positions at RCO in Colombia, of which one is Swedish and one is local, and also contributes funding to rapid strategic and catalytic activities of importance for the implementation of the peace agreement between the government and the FARC, as well as the conditions for a complete peace.</narrative>
  </description>
